      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Hard to knock the consistency of SALLY BIGTIME (7) who added to a series of top-three results when she raced parked and stuck on to go under by 1.7m last time. Led for back-to-back wins here prior. Draws wide but has the speed to go forward. ISLA ROCHELLE (2) came from wider to win here three back and hasn't been far from the placegetters since. Should get her chance from this draw. LUVARESCHS (1) drew wider and worked but fought well for a 1.4m third last week. The ace draw could see her back in the winners' list. DEBBIE LINCOLN NZ (3) resumes after four-and-a-half months. Draws well and has been readied with two trials, winning the latest.",
